Pilot is guilt in thing below since 172.16.0.16 at 6:40 PM

Confusion on puzzle for UIDs (which check everything to get UID (which is then used for IP))
A log with a 4 and a 8 in its port number has a UID of CHhAvVGS1DHFjwGM9 (DNS or SSL)
A log with a timestamp ending in 800.0 has a UID of C5bLoe2Mvxqhawzqqd (HTTP or DNS)
A log with a response IP of 203.0.113.53 cannot have the ID CsukF91Bx9mrqdEaH9 (not DNS)
A log with a response an incoming port beginning in 5 doesn't have a UID with "suk" in it (HTTP is not the not DNS one)

[[Actual Puzzle]]

An advanced hacker curled our domain to get info

Engineer was on 172.16.0.15 at 1:40-5:00 PM
IT was on 172.16.0.16 at 1:00-5:30 PM
Pilot was on 172.16.0.16 at 5:30-6:45 PM
Chef was on 172.16.0.15 at 5:00-8:30 PM

Figure out who did the malicious attack
Use the clues and bank to fill out the logs [blank] and solve them

Clues
Proto: 
Standard proto for said service

Response Ports:
The responder ports are the standard/typical ports for said service

Time:
The timestamp of the log that uses UDP is 1792780800.0
The log representing encrypted information has a timestamp of 1792780900.0
A log with the respond IP 93.184.216.34 has a timestamp of 1792798800.0

Response IP:
The log that occurs 1:40pm our time is the log with a 203.0.113.53 response IP

Incoming Ports:
The log with a recursion desired flag set has an incoming port of 49822
The log with a responder port of 443 has an incoming port of 55109
The log that with over 30 packets passed back and forth has an incoming port of 46378

Origin Ports:
A log with a 4 and a 8 in its port number has a UID of CHhAvVGS1DHFjwGM9
A log with a timestamp ending in 800.0 has a UID of C5bLoe2Mvxqhawzqqd
A log with a response IP of 203.0.113.53 cannot have the UID CsukF91Bx9mrqdEaH9
A log with a response an incoming port beginning in 5 doesn't have a UID with "suk" in it

Origin IP:
The log with a UID of CHhAvVGS1DHFjwGM9 corresponds with 172.16.0.15
The log with a UID of CsukF91Bx9mrqdEaH9 corresponds with 172.16.0.15
The log with a UID of C5bLoe2Mvxqhawzqqd corresponds with 172.16.0.16

